GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/settings/statuses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### 7.3 Add Lead Status
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/settings/statuses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "value": "Under Negotiation"
}


### 7.4 Delete Lead Status
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/settings/statuses/Under%20Negotiation
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### 7.5 Get Lead Sources
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/settings/sources
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### 7.6 Add Lead Source
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/settings/sources
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "value": "Trade Show 2026"
}


### 7.7 Delete Lead Source
