### 7.13 Get Follow-Up Settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/settings/followup
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### 7.14 Update Follow-Up Settings
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/settings/followup
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "defaultReminderDaysBefore": 2,
  "enableEmailReminders": true,
  "enableSmsReminders": true,
  "defaultFollowUpType": "Meeting",
  "autoEscalateAfterDaysOverdue": 4
}
